  (text "CAN1 = native TWAI (vehicle bus).  CAN2 = MCP2518FD on SPI (CAN-FD capable).\nRs tied to GND = high-speed mode.  120R terminators on solder jumpers, default OPEN (mid-bus).\nY1: 40 MHz; load caps C16/C17 depend on the crystal CL (12 pF placeholder)."
